Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.81,0:00:02.35,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:05.26,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying you \Nhave a thing for Misuzu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:07.05,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:10.90,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You know we went out for a \Nwhile in middle school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:15.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:20.19,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why didn't they tell me about this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:25.51,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Aren't they my best friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:02:01.01,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fsp3.5\fad(515,1)\pos(325,150)}Best Bu{\3c&H5A5659&\c&HEBEBEB&}d's {\c&H5A5659&\3c&HEBEBEB&}Secret
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.80,main,Title,0,0,0,,"Best Bud's Secret."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:03.93,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, Misuzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:07.18,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What's this about you going out \Nwith Jun in middle school?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:10.56,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,He finally let it slip, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:11.81,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:15.53,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You know how I feel about Jun, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:17.32,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I didn't back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:22.37,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You didn't tell me you liked Junichiro until \Nright before we graduated middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:29.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,S-Still! If we were best friends, \Nyou could've told me you had a boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:32.33,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Both Junichiro and I wanted \Nto forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:35.42,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Besides, we didn't even \Nhave time to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:36.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:41.18,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Because we were only a couple for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.01,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Three days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:46.93,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Now that you know, I might \Nas well tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:50.19,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It was in the spring of our \Nsecond year of middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.86,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,He just asked me out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:58.99,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Gundo, would you... \Nmaybe try going out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:08.08,flashback,Misuzu,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:12.92,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Even back then, a lot of girls \Nliked him for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:15.29,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,so I kinda wanted to show him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:17.63,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Th-That was all it took?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:19.76,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Call it youthful indiscretion, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:23.14,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I started to feel like I was \Nreaching my limit the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:24.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,The next day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:28.39,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It was the day of our first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.85,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,He invited me to go cycling with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:34.44,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,so I agreed without giving \Nit much thought, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:44.95,flashback,Misuzu,0,0,0,,So... how far are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:46.58,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.03,0:03:51.29,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,We repeated that exchange for two hours \Nwhile traveling forty kilometers one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:55.92,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Well?! Awesome view, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:00.34,flashback,Misuzu,0,0,0,,View?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:02.84,flashback,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Are you a total moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:03.55,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:08.89,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,He dragged me all around again the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:11.43,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I lost five kilograms in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:15.19,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Uh... What was so bad about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:17.90,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You two are insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:21.65,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I had hit my limit both \Nphysically and mentally,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.65,0:04:24.61,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,so after the break, I approached \Nhim to call it quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:26.87,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But then he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:29.54,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sorry, Misuzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:30.20,flashback,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:33.33,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I know this sounds weird when I'm \Nthe one who asked you out, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:38.04,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I feel like maybe we're not \Na good match after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:41.63,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,So let's just give up on going out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:46.68,flashback italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,He... beat me to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:51.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,He put a permanent black mark on my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:53.06,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive him for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.52,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,A lot of things suddenly make sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:59.32,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,So... you don't have any feelings \Nfor Jun anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:01.82,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Oh, I have feelings for him. \NAnd all of them are hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:03.28,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:09.74,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,A-Also, when you guys were \Ngoing out, did you... er, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:12.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,k-k-k-k...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.50,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,kiss or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:18.75,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,The fact that we didn't share any mucosal \Ncontact is our one silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:20.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Don't describe it as mucosal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:23.01,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Well, if I had to say how far...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:25.42,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,We called each other by our given names
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:27.97,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,and held hands while walking \Nto and from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:30.47,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But nothing major, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:32.06,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.14,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:38.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,But I don't feel like I've been \Ndiscussing a relationship at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:41.23,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You told Tomo about us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:43.44,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I did plan to tell her eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:46.07,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:47.66,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:52.74,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Anyway, I didn't notice since I was \Ntrying my hardest to forget it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:58.04,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,but you avoided Tomo for pretty much the \Nentire first year of middle school, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:03.38,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'll spare you all my questions about why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:06.84,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But the time when you two went \Nback to being best friends
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.47,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,happened to be right when \Nyou and I broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:12.35,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Was that a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:15.22,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I was entirely to blame for \Neverything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:18.94,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,If you're mad about it,\N it's not too late to hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:22.69,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,So there really was something going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:23.98,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hit me all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:28.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,There's really nothing between \Nyou and Misuzu anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.45,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Really{\i0} nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:33.58,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I told you there's nothing. \NHow many times are you gonna ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:35.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well, I was the only one \Nwho didn't know about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:38.83,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:40.92,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:44.71,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Is there anyone you like now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:46.88,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh? Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:48.09,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:50.51,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yes, really. What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:54.72,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, okay! As long as there isn't anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.10,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,There isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:56.81,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:58.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:00.64,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:09.32,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Morning, Aizawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.53,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Misaki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.03,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Misaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:19.83,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Wait, he's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:23.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Senpai, this here is Jun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.29,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:28.21,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Hi! I'm Misaki Kosuke, second-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:28.92,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Nice to—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:32.05,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What'd you do that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:32.97,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sorry. Reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:34.97,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That wasn't a reflex!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:40.14,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'm Kubota Junichiro. Sorry for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:42.98,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I-It's okay. No hard feelings here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:45.98,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I hear you do karate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.45,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:50.40,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Let's have a match sometime, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.28,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'll crush you with every \Nounce of strength I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:54.11,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Cru...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:57.70,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Senpai! \NI'll give him a good talking-to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:56.66,top,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That hurts, Tomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.95,top,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:01.33,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,R-Really, it's okay. You can let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:01.33,top,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo... Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:06.34,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why are you so close to the \Ncaptain of the boys' club?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:07.71,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Aren't you in the girls' club?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.26,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:13.26,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Stuff happened, and I'm \Nin the boys' club now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.30,flashback,Goro,0,0,0,,What a disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:20.98,flashback,Goro,0,0,0,,The heir to the Aizawa style, \Nlearning karate in {\i1}school{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.43,flashback,Goro,0,0,0,,And what about you, Jun-bo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:24.98,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'll be sticking with you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:26.15,flashback,Goro,0,0,0,,Well said!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:29.19,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:35.20,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo, let's head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:38.62,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Sorry, I promised to get tea with \NMisuzu and Carol after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:43.04,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! Don't pout!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:45.54,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'm not pouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.63,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yes, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:51.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, okay? I'll walk \Nhome with you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.38,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, then. You'd better stick to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:55.13,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.80,main,Carol,0,0,0,,They're not dating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:00.14,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,That's right. Ridiculous, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:01.60,sign_14628_147_Uenomizu,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz-12.47\fax0.21\pos(370,90)}Uenomizu
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:04.06,sign_14628_147_Uenomizu,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs13\bord2\pos(470,20)}Uenomizu\NHigh\N School
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:06.77,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I... I can't believe I ran into him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:11.28,flashback,Tomo,0,0,0,,Senpai's scared of me now \N'cause you threatened him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:15.03,flashback,Tomo,0,0,0,,Next time you see him, \Nsmooth it out! Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:16.86,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,So you live this way, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:20.12,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Yeah. I usually ride my bike,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:21.83,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,but it's in for repairs right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.79,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,And that's why you're taking \Nthe bus today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:26.50,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:29.88,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why are you standing so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.67,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I-It's just your imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:42.18,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Y-You don't want to join \Nthe karate club, Jun-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.85,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:47.31,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I see... S-Sorry for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:50.98,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I don't think I could beat Tomo, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:55.11,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That's another reason I don't \Nwant to join the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.11,0:09:56.57,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:10:01.58,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But Aizawa-san was saying there \Nwas no way she could beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:04.58,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That's just at her dad's dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:09.08,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,When there are actual rules \Nto follow, I don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:12.09,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I can manage to beat her in a fight, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:15.96,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Fight? You mean you and \NAizawa-san just... punch each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:17.01,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.26,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:21.51,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Aizawa-san is a girl, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:26.52,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,It's not like I want to hurt Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:27.85,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's{\i0} the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:32.23,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Whenever we fight, \Nshe comes after me for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:36.15,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Well... I can see why you would feel \Nlike your life was in danger, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:40.95,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,If I can beat her in a contest of strength, \Nit's only because I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:45.54,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,In a sport with fixed rules, \NI'm still the challenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:49.83,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I see. She is pretty incredible, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:51.42,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Too incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:55.50,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I still wish I could be like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:57.21,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,As I am now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:11:02.05,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I see. He looks up to \NAizawa-san, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:04.60,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,That makes me feel a sort \Nof kinship with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:08.77,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Oh, I get the feeling I just said a \Nlot of weird stuff without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:11.81,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,If you go blabbing to Tomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:14.77,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I-I won't! I swear I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:18.28,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Never mind! He's still scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:23.20,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I heard you took the same \Nbus home as Jun yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.99,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,He didn't threaten you again, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:27.91,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,No, it was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:30.71,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,We talked a bit, and he \Nwas actually pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.96,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yes! He really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.67,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:38.21,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,He started acting weirdly intimidating \Naround our second year of middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:40.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,and he couldn't make any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.42,0:11:43.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I tried introducing him to \Nsome guys I knew, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:49.14,sign_18549_198_Rrrr___,Text,0,0,0,,Rrrr...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:49.14,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,They were all too scared \Nof him to be his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:53.73,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I knew you'd understand him, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:57.27,top,Tomo,0,0,0,,You're not like all those wusses!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:58.19,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I can't tell her that I'm \Nactually terrified of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.11,0:12:01.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun is a super nice guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:05.62,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,but he doesn't see me as a girl at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:08.33,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Would it kill him to be \Na {\i1}little{\i0} considerate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:08.99,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:13.04,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Actually, I think he probably knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:14.67,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I mean, he—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:16.25,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:20.26,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Looks like you two are \Nhaving fun. Can I join in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:21.27,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:22.97,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:26.30,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,They're such good friends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:32.06,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fsp4.5\fad(515,1)\frz3.65\an1\pos(220,140)}Let's Go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:32.06,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fsp6\fad(515,1)\an1\pos(228,202)\frz4.606}on a Date!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"Let's Go on a Date!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:38.48,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,So, be honest... What do \Nyou think of Aizawa Tomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:40.48,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,L-Like, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:44.19,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,I mean, she's a girl. \NShe even, like, wears a skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:47.62,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,I know, right? That skirt is just wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:49.66,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,No matter how boyish she looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.50,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's Mifune and Ogawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:59.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What a coincidence! \NYou guys come here a lot, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.00,italics,Mifune/Ogawa,0,0,0,,Sh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.96,italics,Mifune,0,0,0,,She's wearing pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.96,italicstop,Ogawa,0,0,0,,She's wearing, like, pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:03.80,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,That's just wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:06.09,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,So, like, not fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.09,0:13:07.43,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:11.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Those two should've joined us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:14.02,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why'd they just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:16.52,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Because you're dressed like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:22.11,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,More importantly, have you hung \Nout with Junichiro recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:25.40,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You haven't, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:30.41,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,We've barely hung out since we \Nstarted high school, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:35.87,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,He invites me out now and then, \Nbut I get weirdly self-conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:39.00,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You pick the most inconvenient \Ntimes to be all girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.79,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,If you put him off too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:44.42,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,he might find someone else \Nto spend his time with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:45.88,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I don't want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:48.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Then you should be the one \Nto invite him out next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:52.89,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But not to the bowling alley or \Nbatting center like you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:55.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong with those?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:56.31,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:14:02.11,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Why don't you act like students and go \Nshopping for clothes or do karaoke for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:05.65,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Me and... Jun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:09.16,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That feels so unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:14.12,flashback italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Try inviting him yourself \Nover our next break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:17.79,flashback,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You've kept him waiting \Nin place for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:20.42,flashback,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I bet he'll come running \Nto you wagging his tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:23.46,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,C'mon, he's not a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.34,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, Jun...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.55,0:14:31.05,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Over our next break... \Nif you're free, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:34.39,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Do you want to, um... \Ngo hang out with me somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:35.85,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:37.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:39.94,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Oh, man, it's been forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:41.56,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Where? Where are we gonna go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:44.61,top,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Well, Tomo? Where are we gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:44.61,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,H-He really is just a big dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:48.28,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You get it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.91,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You can't think of it as just hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:52.24,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're going on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.53,0:14:53.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.95,0:14:55.45,main,Carol,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:57.91,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Can I go, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.42,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:03.38,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,We'll go buy you some clothes after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.75,0:15:06.34,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You only own boys' clothes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:09.22,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh? What I have should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:10.68,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:12.51,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Hey, Tomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:17.22,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Saying you'll go on a date in \Nboys' clothes is a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:20.89,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll go buy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.95,main,Carol,0,0,0,,What kind of outfit should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:34.49,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Let's see... Maybe we should \Nstart with something boyish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:37.58,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Really? Not something girlish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:38.83,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,If we do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:41.87,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,she'll be too uncomfortable \Nto think about the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:45.54,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Besides, he'd probably take off \Nrunning the moment he saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:49.26,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,So taking her from "a boy at first glance"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:53.01,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,to "a girl with some boyish \Nfeatures" is the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:55.14,main,Carol,0,0,0,,That sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:56.76,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:16:00.14,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What kinds of shoes do you have, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:01.17,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:03.94,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,All I have are sneakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:05.65,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,A red pair and a white pair...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.65,0:16:07.65,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I think white would be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:08.86,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:13.95,main,Carol,0,0,0,,How about a simple, boyish outfit \Nthat's sporty but a little girlish?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.07,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Let's go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:17.53,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:20.04,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?! Oh, uh, let's do that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.41,0:16:25.54,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh! How about denim gaucho pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:28.84,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,A white pullover would \Nprobably go best with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:32.81,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I-Is fashion this hard to keep up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:35.47,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping me out, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:37.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'll do something to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.17,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:42.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I only did what I could as your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:44.65,main,Carol,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:47.02,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:51.74,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Just tell us every last detail of \Neverything that happens on your date,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:53.15,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,and we'll call it even.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:54.66,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.37,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:17:00.91,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I think they just formed a \Npowerful new tag team.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:07.38,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Sorry, Jun. Were you waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:13.72,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.34,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Okay, well, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:17.51,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:21.22,sign_28002_314_Batting_Center,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz-9.54\fax0.14\fsp6\pos(385,55)}Batting Center
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:21.22,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Man, it's been ages
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:23.43,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,since the last time I came here with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:25.27,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Shoot...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:28.27,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,This is just turning out like the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:32.03,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't this the spot where the \Npitches can hit 160 kilometers per hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.03,0:17:35.74,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's about the speed \NI've been hitting lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:40.12,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,We were both hitting at 120 kilometers \Nper hour not long ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:42.66,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,There's no way I can hit 160.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:44.62,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Try hitting one, Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:49.96,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Nice batting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:52.55,sign_28784_325_Tanaka_Bowling,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz-9.89\fax0.13\pos(285,205)\fay-.01}Tanaka Bowling
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:55.05,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,We haven't been here in ages, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:57.97,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,We're just following the \Nsame plan we used to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:17:58.51,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:18:00.76,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That one's 16 pounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.76,0:18:03.27,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah. This is what I've been using lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:07.10,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,He was using a lighter ball before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:08.73,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I can't even lift one that heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:10.61,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Wanna try this one out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.90,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:19.94,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,No! I gotta change something up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:25.25,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you wanna do karaoke \Nor something next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:26.29,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.92,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I guess not, huh? But, y'know, every once in a—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.04,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:35.88,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh, so this is how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.17,0:18:39.13,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I thought a place like this \Nwould be... louder and busier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:41.55,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,This room is so small and dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.01,main,Devil Misuzu,0,0,0,,Go on. Sit next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:45.89,main,Angel Carol,0,0,0,,Get all up against him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:46.89,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:49.06,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.48,0:18:53.02,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Sing?! No way in hell I'm gonna sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.53,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why did we come here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:59.99,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,W-Well, why did {\i1}you{\i0} agree \Nto come here so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:03.16,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You never cared about karaoke before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.49,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,'Cause you said you wanted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:06.41,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:10.96,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Ever since we were kids, you only \Never wanted to do reckless stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:14.46,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Frankly, I just let you coerce \Nme into going along at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:16.96,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,but I was scared out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.38,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You were?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:23.01,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,But when I just tried doing what \Nyou asked, it was always fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:25.85,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That's why you're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:31.15,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,That's right... Jun just came \Nalong today to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:32.60,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yet I've been...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:35.86,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I can't keep going like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:37.40,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I gotta do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:38.99,top,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Oh, gonna sing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:39.32,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,or this whole day will be ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:43.28,sign_31439_365_The_Rolling_Acor,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(378,125)\fsp.5}The Rolling Acorn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:44.74,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I can't sit around being embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:49.62,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Roll, roll, roll, went the acorn...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:53.83,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Right into the pond! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:58.13,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Along came a loach, saying, "Hello there!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:20:02.22,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"Come play with me, little one!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:03.09,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:07.06,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You're up next!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:09.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Don't laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:14.15,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sorry... That just wasn't \Nwhat I expected at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:15.77,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,But seriously, a children's song?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:18.07,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You really are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:20.90,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:27.62,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,So when Junichiro wasn't willing to sing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:30.29,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,you just sang children's songs \Nfor three hours and went home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:33.33,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I was so embarrassed, I thought I'd die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:35.75,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,He even shot a video of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.09,0:20:38.71,main,Carol,0,0,0,,It sounds like it went great, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:42.76,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure. Sounds like the \Nwrong way to have fun to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:47.18,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I guess I should delete the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:48.85,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Junichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:49.64,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.18,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Show us the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:59.23,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:05.36,italicstop,Tomo,0,0,0,,"Come play with me, little one!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:06.20,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That whole day, there was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:09.12,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey! Why are you filming me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:11.66,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,...something different about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.39,0:22:53.02,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,My feelings drift through the starry sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:56.09,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,so far away...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,She's a natural...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:23:01.47,top,Misuzu,0,0,0,,They won't reach you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:00.57,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You're so good, Misuzu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.47,0:23:03.48,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Bounce with me, bounce with me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:06.24,main,Carol,0,0,0,,All the sanity is sin, sin, sin here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:08.36,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,She's so good at singing in English!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:08.40,top,Carol,0,0,0,,Bounce with me, bounce with me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:10.99,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I almost forgot she wasn't Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.40,0:23:10.99,top,Carol,0,0,0,,Move it down, up, down, up, \Nkeepin' it up, boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.99,0:23:14.23,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Boom, boom! Boom, boom! Boom, boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.77,0:23:16.76,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Your turn, Tomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.40,0:23:20.06,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Well, you're up, Queen of Children's Songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:23.99,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,P-Please spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.99,0:23:26.71,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,The cat scratched me, the cat scratched me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.71,0:23:28.88,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,the cat was startled and scratched me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.88,0:23:31.54,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I stepped on the cat, I stepped on the cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.54,0:23:33.97,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I stepped on the cat, and it scratched me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:36.34,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,The cat scratched me, the cat scratched me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:39.47,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,the cat was startled and scratched me!
